<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS4" title="In Appendix C Characteristics of Retrieval Transition Heads ‣ Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.4 </span>Analyzing variability introduced by LLM-based aligner</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Causal Intervention through Attention Head Masking</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">E</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Additional experiments and Qualitative analysis of Retrieval-Transition Heads</span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS1" title="In Appendix E Additional experiments and Qualitative analysis of Retrieval-Transition Heads ‣ Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.1 </span>Effect of hyperparameter <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">k</span> (number of heads masked)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS2" title="In Appendix E Additional experiments and Qualitative analysis of Retrieval-Transition Heads ‣ Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.2 </span>LLM-as-a-judge prompt for failure-mode categorization</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS3" title="In Appendix E Additional experiments and Qualitative analysis of Retrieval-Transition Heads ‣ Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.3 </span>Qualitative Examples of failure modes on masking Retrieval-Transition heads</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A5.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In E.3 Qualitative Examples of failure modes on masking Retrieval-Transition heads ‣ Appendix E Additional experiments and Qualitative analysis of Retrieval-Transition Heads ‣ Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Failure Mode 1: Lack of Coherence.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In E.3 Qualitative Examples of failure modes on masking Retrieval-Transition heads ‣ Appendix E Additional experiments and Qualitative analysis of Retrieval-Transition Heads ‣ Bridging Latent Reasoning and Target-Language Generation via Retrieval-Transition Heads" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Failure Mode 2: Failure to Retrieval Capabilities.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
